    "name": "Confluent Schema Registry Compatibility Server API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Confluent Schema Registry provides a RESTful interface for storing and retrieving Avro, JSON Schema, and Protobuf schemas. It stores a versioned history of all schemas based on a specified subject name strategy, provides multiple compatibility settings, and allows evolution of schemas according to configured compatibility settings.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Confluent",
